pan class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class =\\\"strong\\\">Blake</span>: Thank you!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> <span class =\\\"strong\\\">Sonia</span>: Can I get a sandwich?</span> <br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class =\\\"strong\\\">Clerk</span>: Sure! Here you go!</span><br /> <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class =\\\"strong\\\">Sonia</span>: Thanks!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "concession stand"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place in a movie theater where you can buy food like popcorn, sodas, etc."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class =\"strong\">Tom</span>: I want to eat something during the movie.<br /> <span class =\"strong\">Lisa</span>: Let's get something at the concession stand."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob07aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Use these words to talk about food at the movies."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hot dog "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "sausage in a long roll, usually inside a bun "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love eating hot dogs."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob07aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "candy"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a tasty sweet, can be hard or soft"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's get some candy."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le03ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "not a big fan"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I don't really like ... "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"},